== Description ==

The '''Gunsmith Workbench''' assembles firearms, ammunition, and firearm attachments. It defines 44 raw recipe entries (44 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[12x70mm Chrome]], [[12x70mm Copper]], [[12x70mm Steel]], [[12x70mm Titanium]], [[12x70mm Tungsten]], [[5.56x45mm Chrome]], [[5.56x45mm Copper]], [[5.56x45mm Steel]], plus 36 more.

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.GunWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Gunsmith</code>.

